            "<blockquote>"
            "Send the Telegram User ID of the ONLY person allowed to open this gift.\n"
            "Example: <code>8335116442</code> or <code>vyzne</code>\n\n"
            "<i>(The gift content will be delivered exclusively to this user in private!)</i>"
